      "sourceHash": "526e0087cc3f254d",
      "translationZh": "描述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb099d80b8d9dbf1",
      "translationZh": "单 GPU 训练的推荐值（截至目前）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe30af4e170ad79b",
      "translationZh": "训练的轮数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26413b876b992476",
      "translationZh": "训练时使用的批大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4c04f084e3dcc1f",
      "translationZh": "采样时使用的批大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f026fefadb849c5c",
      "translationZh": "使用的基于加速器的梯度累积步数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4981d3ea5c294607",
      "translationZh": "采样步数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb58b6a3bc647c8a",
      "translationZh": "每个训练轮次采样的批次数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65cb3405da123f98",
      "translationZh": "是否按提示词跟踪统计量。如果为 false，则使用整个批次的均值和标准差来计算优势值，而不是按提示词跟踪统计量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cbc87c7681f34db",
      "translationZh": "真",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c12ae6f7ffb0a062",
      "translationZh": "用于跟踪每个提示词统计信息的缓冲区大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dbd359a516d7b54",
      "translationZh": "混合精度训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cbc87c7681f34db",
      "translationZh": "真",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f033c501afe798cd",
      "translationZh": "学习率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfbe75e68b21e131",
      "translationZh": "所提供的脚本仅仅是一个起点。你可以自由调整超参数，甚至彻底改造脚本，以适应不同的目标函数。例如，可以集成一个衡量 JPEG 可压缩性的函数，或一个利用多模态模型评估视觉与文本对齐程度的函数，当然还有其他可能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "356bd1224c9a999a",
      "translationZh": "经验总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4463d2e643db6429",
      "translationZh": "尽管训练提示词的数量极少，结果似乎仍能泛化到各种各样的提示词。这一点已在奖励美感的目标函数上得到充分验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9d7a63a45f19fd3",
      "translationZh": "至少对于美感目标函数而言，通过增加训练提示词的数量并使提示词多样化来显式提升泛化能力的尝试，似乎会减慢收敛速度，而学到的泛化行为即使存在，也几乎难以察觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfc5026eb14c0bef",
      "translationZh": "虽然 LoRA 值得推荐，而且经过了多次尝试和验证，但非 LoRA 方案也值得考虑。其中一个原因是，实证证据表明，non-Lora 似乎确实能生成比 LoRA 相对更精细复杂的图像。不过，要找到合适的超参数，使非 LoRA 训练稳定运行，难度要大得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26cef0325dcdcd01",
      "translationZh": "对于 non-Lora，配置参数的建议是：将学习率设得相对较低，1e-5 左右应该就能奏效，并将 mixed_precision 设为 None。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae27ac4f451c9c96",
      "translationZh": "以下是针对提示词 bear、heaven 和 dune，在微调前（左）和微调后（右）的输出结果（每一行对应一个提示词的输出）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "518783e6bdb4965c",
      "translationZh": "微调前",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9c721fe8a0cfc19",
      "translationZh": "微调后",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69b1b67de5ef98be",
      "translationZh": "局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ff9b18448e13643",
      "translationZh": "目前，trl 的 DDPOTrainer 仅支持对原版 SD 模型进行微调；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c80748f41475e2b2",
      "translationZh": "在我们的实验中，我们主要关注 LoRA，其效果非常好。我们也进行了一些全量训练实验，这可以带来更好的质量，但找到合适的超参数更具挑战性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "737316815a58eb2f",
      "translationZh": "像 Stable Diffusion 这样的扩散模型，在使用 DDPO 进行微调后，可以显著提升生成图像的质量，无论是以人类感知来衡量，还是以任何其他指标来衡量，只要将相应的评价标准恰当地表述为目标函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c186eabbb407873",
      "translationZh": "DDPO 的计算效率，以及无需依赖近似即可进行优化的能力，尤其是相较于以往用于实现微调扩散模型这一相同目标的方法所具备的优势，使其成为微调 Stable Diffusion 等扩散模型的合适候选方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6510d0b3931fb55d",
      "translationZh": "trl 库的 DDPOTrainer 实现了 DDPO，用于微调 SD 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "550d5e63769a54c0",
      "translationZh": "我们的实验结果凸显了 DDPO 在广泛的提示词上实现泛化的强大能力，不过，通过改变提示词来显式实现泛化的尝试结果好坏参半。在非 LoRA 配置下难以找到合适的超参数，也是我们获得的一项重要经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfad7867f827a422",
      "translationZh": "DDPO 是一种很有前景的技术，可使扩散模型与任意奖励函数对齐。我们希望，通过在 TRL 中发布这项技术，能让社区更便捷地使用它！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4cdd06b7c09fd5d",
      "translationZh": "感谢 Chunte Lee 为本篇博文制作缩略图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "Diffusion models",
      "briefZh": "扩散模型",
      "explanationZh": "一类生成模型，本文关注其图像生成能力及如何通过强化学习进行微调。"
    },
    {
      "term": "alignment problem",
      "briefZh": "对齐问题",
      "explanationZh": "如何确保模型输出符合人类偏好或难以用提示词表达的意图这一问题。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback",
      "briefZh": "人类反馈强化学习",
      "explanationZh": "利用人类反馈进行强化学习，使模型的行为或输出更符合人类偏好。"
    },
    {
      "term": "objective function",
      "briefZh": "目标函数",
      "explanationZh": "用于定义优化目标的函数，文中用它指导扩散模型的微调。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Denoising Diffusion Policy Optimization",
      "briefZh": "去噪扩散策略优化",
      "explanationZh": "简称 DDPO，一种利用强化学习对扩散模型进行微调的方法。"
    },
    {
      "term": "fine-tune",
      "briefZh": "微调",
      "explanationZh": "在已有模型的基础上进一步训练，使其更符合特定目标。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Reward-weighted regression",
      "briefZh": "奖励加权回归",
      "explanationZh": "根据样本对应的奖励对训练损失进行加权的回归方法，文中用它来微调扩散模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "denoising loss function",
      "briefZh": "去噪损失函数",
      "explanationZh": "用于衡量扩散模型去除噪声效果的训练目标函数。"
    },
    {
      "term": "maximum likelihood objective",
      "briefZh": "最大似然目标",
      "explanationZh": "通过调整模型参数，使观测样本在模型下的似然尽可能大的优化目标。"
    },
    {
      "term": "variational bound",
      "briefZh": "变分界",
      "explanationZh": "通过变分方法构造的界，用于近似或优化难以直接计算的目标。"
    },
